    "created_at": "2024-07-15T17:47:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-15T17:47:27Z",
    "body": "In Chromium based browsers it is still behind a flag, but enabled for test which is why the WPT are passing. Sites can't use it for general users because the flag must be explicitly enabled by an end-user. Hence no usage and safe to remove.\r\n\r\nI've revive @junov 's PR to remove it from the spec.",
